  {
   "id": "oirbo-118398@major-2025-01-14",
   "gameId": "oirbo-118398",
   "displayName": "New Update and a big annoucement!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-14T17:01:17.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Like we promised, we just pushed a new update to Oirbo, you can download it now (changelog below)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More importantly, we finally decided when Oirbo will come out of early access!!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "10 of February!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "So mark the dates on your calendar :D.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We still have a bunch of work to do before the release, still, it's time, with the release of the control bay area and the overall feedback we've been having it's a matter of closing loose ends and polishing the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We want to thank again everyone who came along with us on this journey. Although Oirbo development won't be stopping anytime soon (even after the release), getting out of early access is still a major accomplishment for us, especially on a game that we've been developing for almost eight years!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "0.11.1 EA",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added sound to the final boss's initial cutscene",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added sound to the intro cutscene",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added boss fight tracks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added skill popup on the collection",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 100% achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues related to some boss activations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed possible soft lock between the control bay and nature area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues that maintained Oirbo in a dark room, even when it shouldn’t",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bunch of visual anomalies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
