  {
   "id": "oirbo-118398@0.9.24",
   "gameId": "oirbo-118398",
   "displayName": "Update 0.9.24",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-29T17:29:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everybody!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sorry for the 2-week hiatus, the team had a bunch of other random stuff that kept us well-occupied so we had to break our weekly update streak.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On good news, we finally started development of the 5th and last area (at least for release) and decided to aim for a June/July final release (just to set a clear goal for us), the intro update is still on QA but we expect to eventually release it to anyone that wishes to try it out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to all Oirbo fans, for the awesome feedback you keep sending us (even when we don't update the game xD), keep it coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "0.9.24 changelog",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More steam deck improvements x2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Vastly improved sections memory management",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed hiccups on the Nature bay bee's sections",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "A bunch of small bugs and visual issues fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buffed Oirbo cuteness by 42%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
